msgid "Northwest India. Nearby rivers swell with monsoon rains, allowing for only a few treacherous crossings.\n\nThe rivers are heavily forested, while grasslands carpet the surrounding countryside. Watch out for Tigers in the tall grass! Asian elephants are also a common sight."
