msgid "Start by selecting the resource you wish to sell from the upper row. For each time the lower buttons are pressed, %(quantity)s of the upper resource will be sold for the displayed quantity of the lower. Press and hold %(hotkey)s to temporarily multiply the traded amount by %(multiplier)s."
